msgid ""
"昇腾性能调优指南\n"
"====================================\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Ascend Performance Tuning Guide\n"
"====================================\n"
""

msgid ""
"`Perf Tuning <https://github.com/verl-project/verl/blob/main/docs/perf/perf_tuning.rst>`_ 中介绍的性能调优方法在昇腾设备中同样适用。本文重点介绍了昇腾特有的一些调优手段，包括融合算子优化、特定硬件配置和昇腾亲和特性等。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The performance tuning methods described in `Perf Tuning <https://github.com/verl-project/verl/blob/main/docs/perf/perf_tuning.rst>`_ also apply to Ascend devices. This document focuses on Ascend-specific tuning methods, including operator fusion optimization, specific hardware configurations, and Ascend affinity features, and so on.\n"
""

msgid ""
"融合算子\n"
"--------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Fusion Operators\n"
"--------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"常用融合算子列表\n"
"**********************************\n"
""
msgstr ""
"List of common fused operators\n"
"**********************************\n"
""

msgid ""
"融合算子的优化原理为，通过数学意义上的等价替换，将多个算子融为一个算子的计算，减少冗余计算，同时减少下发次数，从而提高性能。几个典型的NPU融合算子列举如下，目前均已在 npu_patch.py 中对 Qwen2、Qwen3 系列模型完成替换。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The optimization principle of fused operators is to use mathematical equivalent replacement to fuse multiple operators into a single operator. This reduces redundant computation and the number of dispatches, thereby improving performance. Several typical NPU fused operators are listed below. Currently, all these operators have been replaced in npu_patch.py for the Qwen2 and Qwen3 series models.\n"
""

msgid ""
"当前verl中使用的全量融合算子请查阅 `npu_patch.py <https://github.com/verl-project/verl/blob/main/verl/models/transformers/npu_patch.py>`_ \n"
""
msgstr ""
"For the full fused operators currently used in verl, refer to `npu_patch.py <https://github.com/verl-project/verl/blob/main/verl/models/transformers/npu_patch.py>`_\n"
""

msgid ""
"Matrix Computation-Communication operator fusion (MC2) \n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"MC2 是 CANN 中一系列计算通信融合算子的统称，这些算子将原本串行的通信和计算操作融合在一起，通过内部的切分和流水线并行执行来优化性能。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Matrix Computation-Communication operator fusion (MC2) \n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"MC2 is a collective term for a series of computation-communication fusion operators in CANN. These operators fuse originally sequential communication and computation operations. They optimize performance through internal splitting and pipeline parallel execution.\n"
""

msgid ""
"在 vllm-ascend 中，可以通过指定环境变量：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"In vllm-ascend, you can specify environment variables:\n"
""

msgid ""
"在前向计算的 ``RowParallelLinear`` 中使能 ``torch_npu.npu_mm_all_reduce_base`` ，将分离的 ``matmul`` 和 ``allreduce`` 合并为一个融合算子。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Enable ``torch_npu.npu_mm_all_reduce_base`` in the ``RowParallelLinear`` during the forward computation to merge the separate ``matmul`` and ``allreduce`` into a single fused operator.\n"
""

msgid ""
"torch_npu 接口:  ``torch_npu.npu_rotary_mul(x, r1, r2)``\n"
""
msgstr ""
"torch_npu interface:  ``torch_npu.npu_rotary_mul(x, r1, r2)``\n"
""

msgid ""
"参数说明: \n"
""
msgstr ""
"Parameter description:\n"
""

msgid ""
