msgid ""
"昇腾通用配置\n"
"--------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"General Ascend Configuration\n"
"----------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"`算子下发 <https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/Pytorch/latest/apiref/ENV/docs/zh/environment_variable_reference/TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE.md>`_\n"
"************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************\n"
""
msgstr ""
"`Operator dispatch <https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/Pytorch/latest/apiref/ENV/docs/zh/environment_variable_reference/TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE.md>`_\n"
"************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************\n"
""

msgid ""
"通过 ``TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE`` 可配置 task_queue 算子下发队列优化等级，默认为 Level 1 优化。该配置可以减少host下发时间，可用于缓解由下发导致的整体free过大问题。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"You can configure the optimization level of the task_queue operator dispatch queue using ``TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE``. The default is Level 1 optimization. This configuration reduces the host dispatch time and can alleviate the issue of excessive overall free time caused by dispatching.\n"
""

msgid ""
"Level 0 : 不开启下发流水优化。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Level 0 : Dispatch pipeline optimization is not enabled.\n"
""

msgid ""
"Level 1 : 将算子下发任务分为两段，一部分任务（主要是 aclnn 算子的调用）放在新增的二级流水上，一、二级流水通过算子队列传递任务，相互并行，通过部分掩盖减少整体的下发耗时，提升端到端性能。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Level 1 : This level splits the operator dispatch task into two stages. One part of the task (mainly the aclnn operator calls) is placed on the newly added second-level pipeline. The first-level and second-level pipelines pass tasks through an operator queue and run in parallel. By partially overlapping execution, the overall dispatch time is reduced, improving end-to-end performance.\n"
""

msgid ""
"Level 2 : 基于 Level 1 的优化进一步平衡了一、二级流水的任务负载，主要是将 workspace 相关任务迁移至二级流水，掩盖效果更好，性能收益更大。该配置仅在二进制场景生效，建议配置值为 Level 2 优化。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Level 2 : Based on the Level 1 optimization, this further balances the workload of the level-1 and level-2 pipelines. It mainly migrates workspace-related tasks to the level-2 pipeline, providing better masking effects and greater performance gains. This configuration takes effect only in binary scenarios, and the recommended configuration value is Level 2 optimization.\n"
""

msgid ""
"`通讯算法编排展开 <https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/maintenref/envvar/envref_07_0096.html>`_\n"
"************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************\n"
"使用环境变量 ``HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV`` 用于配置通信算法的编排展开位置，支持如下取值: \n"
""
msgstr ""
"`Communication Algorithm Orchestration Expansion <https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/850/maintenref/envvar/envref_07_0096.html>`_\n"
"************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************\n"
"Use the environment variable ``HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV`` to configure the orchestration expansion location of the communication algorithm. The following values are supported:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- **AI_CPU:** 代表通信算法的编排展开位置在 Device 侧的 AI CPU，Device 侧根据硬件型号自动选择相应的调度器。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- **AI_CPU:** Indicates that the orchestration expansion location of the communication algorithm is on the AI CPU on the Device side. The Device side automatically selects the corresponding scheduler based on the hardware model.\n"
""

msgid ""
"- **AIV:** 代表通信算法的编排展开位置在 Device 侧的 Vector Core，执行也在 Vector Core。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- **AIV:** indicates that the orchestration and expansion location of the communication algorithm is on the Vector Core on the device side, and execution is also on the Vector Core.\n"
""

msgid ""
"- **HOST:** 代表通信算法的编排展开位置为 Host 侧 CPU，Device 侧根据硬件型号自动选择相应的调度器。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- **HOST:** Indicates that the communication algorithm is orchestrated and expanded on the host-side CPU; the device side automatically selects the appropriate scheduler based on the hardware model.\n"
""

msgid ""
"- **HOST_TS:** 代表通信算法的编排展开位置为 Host 侧 CPU，Host 向 Device 的 Task Scheduler 下发任务，Device 的 Task Scheduler 进行任务调度执行。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- **HOST_TS:** Indicates that the orchestration and expansion location of the communication algorithm is on the Host-side CPU. The Host issues tasks to the Task Scheduler on the Device, which then schedules and executes the tasks.\n"
""

